<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN MASTERS SECOND ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN MASTERS SECOND ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>PORT EDWARD, South Africa 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading second</p>
<p>round scores in the 750,000 rand ($160,000) South African</p>
<p>Masters golf tournament at the San Lameer Country Club on Friday</p>
<p>(South African unless stated):</p>
<p>138 Adilson da Silva (Brazil) 67 71</p>
<p>139 Mark McNulty (Zimbabwe) 71 68</p>
<p>141 Desvonde Botes 76 65</p>
<p>142 Sean Pappas 72 70, Gavin Levenson 72 70</p>
<p>143 Mark Wiltshire 72 71</p>
<p>144 Graeme van der Nest 75 69, Tjaart van der Walt 78 66</p>
<p>145 Retief Goosen 73 72, Ian Hutchings 73 72, Van Phillips</p>
<p>(Britain) 71 74, Jeff Hawkes 72 73, Brenden Pappas</p>
<p>71 74, Deane Pappas 73 72</p>
<p>146 Mike Board (U.S.) 71 75, Ben Fouchee 71 75, Brad Ott</p>
<p>(U.S.) 72 74.</p>
